{
  "name": "Zero-Subscription Apollo.io Alternative Decision-Maker & Email Finder",
  "nodes": [
    {
      "parameters": {
        "content": "## ⚡ Zero-Subscription Apollo.io Alternative Decision-Maker & Email Finder\n\n**What this workflow does:**\nReplace expensive monthly Apollo subscriptions with on-demand Pay-Per-Event B2B decision-maker contact extraction.\n\n**Powered by Apify Actor:** [`laborious_rumor/apollo-io-lead-alternative-scraper`](https://apify.com/laborious_rumor/apollo-io-lead-alternative-scraper) (*First 1,000 results 100% Free — zero login cookies required!*)\n\n### Setup in 30 Seconds:\n1. Get your free Apify API token at [console.apify.com/settings/integrations](https://console.apify.com/settings/integrations).\n2. Open the **Run Apify B2B Decision-Maker & Verified Email Finder** HTTP Request node and replace `YOUR_APIFY_API_TOKEN` with your token.\n3. Click **Test Workflow** to extract, deduplicate, and score live structured JSON records!",
        "height": 300,
        "width": 640
      },
      "id": "5e09708f-4b8b-44a8-af71-c62f6b7477b8",
      "name": "Sticky Note: Setup Instructions",
      "type": "n8n-nodes-base.stickyNote",
      "typeVersion": 1,
      "position": [
        180,
        60
      ]
    },
    {
      "parameters": {
        "content": "### 🔎 Stage 1: Schedule, Target Queries & Apify Extraction\nTriggers daily, sets your target search queries and `maxItems`, and runs the cookie-free **B2B Decision-Maker & Verified Email Finder** Actor synchronously via the Apify REST API.",
        "height": 220,
        "width": 740
      },
      "id": "b86015a2-bd45-4331-a764-01067cb28979",
      "name": "Sticky Note: Stage 1 Extraction",
      "type": "n8n-nodes-base.stickyNote",
      "typeVersion": 1,
      "position": [
        180,
        380
      ]
    },
    {
      "parameters": {
        "content": "### 🧹 Stage 2: Quality Filtering, Deduplication, Lead Scoring & Export\nFilters verified records, deduplicates by URL/ID, normalizes and scores each record with JavaScript, summarizes the batch, and routes high-priority items downstream.",
        "height": 220,
        "width": 980
      },
      "id": "d154dcbd-fef1-4bbf-a08e-a2acbfb8c922",
      "name": "Sticky Note: Stage 2 Processing",
      "type": "n8n-nodes-base.stickyNote",
      "typeVersion": 1,
      "position": [
        950,
        380
      ]
    },
    {
      "parameters": {
        "rule": {
          "interval": [
            {
              "field": "hours",
              "hoursInterval": 24
            }
          ]
        }
      },
      "id": "9e7dd43c-31c7-44e0-abc5-b7a4843fb33b",
      "name": "Daily Schedule Trigger",
      "type": "n8n-nodes-base.scheduleTrigger",
      "typeVersion": 1.2,
